The matching \(2\times2\) piece occurs in the diagram at rows \(2\)–\(3\), columns \(3\)–\(4\):

\[
\begin{matrix}
\text{club} & \text{star}\\
\text{heart} & \text{club}
\end{matrix}
\]

Rotating this block \(90^\circ\) clockwise gives exactly the arrangement and orientations shown in option D. The other options either have the wrong symbol arrangement or would require turning the piece over.

\[
\boxed{\text{D}}
\]
